      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AGRAFFE ROCKET (1) jumped in trip and grade when held up early in the straight for a battling fourth over 1550m at Canterbury in BM64 class on a heavy (8) track. Will find this more to his liking and no surprise to see him race a touch closer here. Can improve quickly. OURAGAN (6) has shown ability in all three runs back and a win looks imminent. The stable are having a good run at present and doesn't have to improve much to win this. ZOUGOTME (5) rewarded for his consistency second-up with a well-deserved Maiden win from back in the field over 1210m at Moruya. Jean Van Overmeire stays aboard and has solid each-way prospects. ONE RUN WON (3) tongue-tie goes on after he gripped on late to secure third over 1250m at Newcastle. Can push forward from the draw and not without top-four claims.",
